Luke 4:1 , The temptation and fasting of Christ;
Luke 4:14 , He begins to preach;
Luke 4:16 , The people of Nazareth admire his gracious words, but being offended, seek to kill him;
Luke 4:33 , He cures one possessed of a devil
Luke 4:38 . Peter's mother-in-law
Luke 4:40 . and divers other sick persons;
Luke 4:41 , The devils acknowledge Christ, and are reproved for it;
Luke 4:42 , He preaches through the cities of Galilee.
